        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "¿A qué te dedicas?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-1-q-es.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "I work as a software sales engineer.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-1-a-en-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Trabajo como ingeniero de ventas de software.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-1-a-es-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Our company writes software and I have to know it in and out and show it off to customers.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-1-a-en-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Nuestra empresa desarrolla software y yo tengo que conocerlo a fondo y presentárselo a los clientes.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-1-a-es-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      }
    ]
