    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "How did you get into tech?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-3-q-en.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "¿Cómo llegaste al mundo de la tecnología?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-3-q-es.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "I was in the military and we used a lot of cutting edge technology.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-3-a-en-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Estuve en el ejército y usábamos mucha tecnología de punta.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-3-a-es-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "I really liked the tech part but the military pay wasn't great, so I got a job in tech and the pay was much better.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-3-a-en-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Me gustaba mucho la parte tecnológica, pero el sueldo militar no era gran cosa, así que conseguí un trabajo en tecnología y el sueldo era mucho mejor.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-3-a-es-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      }
    ]
  },
