    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "What does your day to day look like?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-4-q-en.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "¿Cómo es tu día a día?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-4-q-es.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "Most days I'm on calls with customers, doing demos, helping people test the software, and helping build the technical case for why they should buy and use our software to solve their problems.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-4-a-en-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "La mayoría de los días estoy en llamadas con clientes, haciendo demos, ayudando a la gente a probar el software, y ayudando a construir el argumento técnico de por qué deberían comprarlo y usarlo para resolver sus problemas.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-core-4-a-es-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      }
    ]
  },
