    "stem": "island-01-work-deeper-1",
    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "What makes a good sales engineer?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-q-en.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "¿Qué hace a un buen ingeniero de ventas?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-q-es.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "A good listener and communicator.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-en-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Saber escuchar y comunicarse bien.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-es-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Anyone can learn the technology, but landing in a room and really understanding what people need — and communicating in a way that resonates — that's the hard part.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-en-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Cualquiera puede aprender la tecnología, pero llegar a una sala y entender de verdad lo que necesita la gente — y comunicarlo de una manera que les llegue — eso es lo difícil.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-es-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "A lot of people get nervous or talk too much or not enough.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-en-s03.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Mucha gente se pone nerviosa o habla demasiado o muy poco.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-es-s03.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "It's really all about communication.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-en-s04.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Al final todo se trata de la comunicación.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-1-a-es-s04.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      }
    ]
  },
