    "mode": "recall",
    "stem": "island-01-work-deeper-2",
    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "What do you think about AI's impact on your field?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-q-en.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "¿Qué piensas del impacto de la IA en tu campo?",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-q-es.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "It's made my job easier for tedious tasks, but at the end of the day I'm a technical storyteller.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-en-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "Me ha facilitado el trabajo en las tareas tediosas, pero al final del día soy un narrador técnico.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-es-s01.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "The story still has to be something I craft and tell.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-en-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "La historia sigue siendo algo que yo construyo y cuento.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-es-s02.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "AI can help with the data but I have to tell the story.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-en-s03.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "La IA puede ayudar con los datos, pero la historia la tengo que contar yo.",
        "audio": "code/audio/tmp/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-es-s03.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      }
    ]
  },
